<content>
  <section><title>Warm Up Activity</title>
<para>Let \(p\) be the function that gives the cost \(p(t)\), in dollars, of producing 1 watt of solar energy
  \(t\)<emphasis> </emphasis>years after 1977. Here is a table showing the values of \(p\)<emphasis> </emphasis>from 1977 to 1987.</para>
  <table>
    <tgroup cols="2"><thead>
      <row>
        <entry>\(t\)</entry>
        <entry>\(p(t)\)</entry>
      </row>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <row>
