        10
      </entry>
      <entry>
        4.51
      </entry>
    </row>
  </tbody>
</tgroup></table> 
<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para>Which expression best represents the average rate of change in solar cost between 1977 and 1987?</para>
    <para>\(
        p(10)−p(0)\) </para>
      <para> \(p(10)\) </para>
      <para> \(\frac{p(10)-p(0)}{10−0}\) </para>
      <para>\(\frac{
        p(10)}{p(0)}\) </para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para>\(\frac{p(10)-p(0)}{10−0}\)</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End --></section>
</content>
